<a href=\"term_energy\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_energy\">energy</a> consumed by a customer through the relevant <a href=\"chap_11_212_term_supply_point\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"local\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"chap_11_212_term_supply_point\">supply point</a> calculated in accordance with S7.2.3.</p></div>",
