          "index": "11.36.4",
          "chapter": "11",
          "content": "<p class=\"level1\">Despite clauses <a href=\"#clause_7.2.2\" data-link-type=\"clause\" data-content=\"874345\">7.2.2</a> and <a href=\"#clause_7.2.3\" data-link-type=\"clause\" data-content=\"874346\">7.2.3</a>, the <a href=\"term_responsible_person\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_responsible_person\">responsible person</a> for a relevant <a href=\"term_metering_installation\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_metering_installation\">metering installation</a> is the regulated distribution system operator to whom the Ministerial smart meter roll out determination (that applies to that relevant <a href=\"term_metering_installation\" class=\"term\"  data-glossary-type=\"global\" data-link-type=\"glossary\" data-content=\"term_metering_installation\">metering installation</a>) applies.</p>",
          "content_type": "clause",
